{"4316280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "APPLECALYPSE", "steam_appid": 4316280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie <strong>point and click</strong> scenes, gather cryptic clues, and dive into billiards style gameplay sections where you <strong>launch apples</strong> and make them bounce through strange, physics based challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrapped in a Lynchian atmosphere and a surreal narrative, uncover a disturbing conspiracy where nothing is what it seems… not even apples.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click sequences focused on exploration and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based gameplay sections inspired by billiards, where you must launch apples and use ricochets to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of real photographic backgrounds as interactive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> Invite a friend and throw apples at each other!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Manzanito and talk to him. He is a genetically modified apple.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316280/extras/0d17f0b1c3fdd3d4a681dff6fa19ec66.poster.avif?t=1785565707\" width=708 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316280/extras/0d17f0b1c3fdd3d4a681dff6fa19ec66.webm?t=1785565707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316280/extras/0d17f0b1c3fdd3d4a681dff6fa19ec66.mp4?t=1785565707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie <strong>point and click</strong> scenes, gather cryptic clues, and dive into billiards style gameplay sections where you <strong>launch apples</strong> and make them bounce through strange, physics based challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wrapped in a Lynchian atmosphere and a surreal narrative, uncover a disturbing conspiracy where nothing is what it seems… not even apples.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click sequences focused on exploration and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based gameplay sections inspired by billiards, where you must launch apples and use ricochets to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of real photographic backgrounds as interactive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versus Mode:</strong> Invite a friend and throw apples at each other!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Manzanito and talk to him. He is a genetically modified apple.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316280/extras/0d17f0b1c3fdd3d4a681dff6fa19ec66.poster.avif?t=1785565707\" width=708 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316280/extras/0d17f0b1c3fdd3d4a681dff6fa19ec66.webm?t=1785565707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4316280/extras/0d17f0b1c3fdd3d4a681dff6fa19ec66.mp4?t=1785565707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Apples are not what they seem. Feed the neighbors until they are full and uncover a conspiracy in this unique point and click adventure that blends exploration of real photos with physics based challenges", "supported_languages": "English